  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix whipped topping, crushed pineapple with juice, vanilla pudding mix, and banana pudding mix together in a mixing bowl. Add more banana pudding mix until desired flavor is reached. Stir in marshmallows. Serve with sliced banana on top.",
